  "type": "module",
  "description": "G G O — Ink-Forge Physics Jousting. Mobile-first 2D clockwork jousting with freehand vehicle sketching, Matter.js physics, Solo Campaign, Online Quick Match (Supabase + WebRTC), and Private Rooms. Simple name-based accounts.",
